=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Zoriboh} and obtain {@k} {k:Care package} key item.
* Speak to {n:Quelveuiat} (I-10) in {z:Tavnazian Safehold}.
* Go to {p:Riverne - Site A01} and go through the portals to the island at I-11. You will receive a cutscene upon reaching the island.
* Trade a {@i:Copper Key|1665} {i:Copper Key|Copper Key|1665} to the Trunk for another cutscene.
** {@i:Copper Key|1665} {i:Copper Key|Copper Key|1665} drops from {m:Riverne Vulture} in {p:Riverne - Site A01}.
* Travel to the {z:Metalworks} and talk to {n:Vladinek} (H-8).
* Go to {p:Bibiki Bay} and take the {z:Manaclipper} to {p:Purgonorgo Isle|Bibiki Bay - Purgonorgo Isle}.
** You can also use the {p:Voidwatch} teleport if you have {p:Bismarck} access.
* Go to F-9 by the Weathered Boat.
* Click the boat for a cutscene. After the cutscene the NM {m:Rohemolipaud} will spawn.
** He will use {p:Eagle Eye Shot}.
** Eventually, he will use {p:Camouflage} and the fight will end.
** If in a party with multiple players that need the quest, there is a 3 minute wait between respawning the NM.
* Click the Weathered Boat again to recieve a cutscene and a {@i:Deluxe Carbine|17274} {p:Deluxe Carbine}.
* Go back to {z:Rabao} and talk to {n:Zoriboh} to complete the quest, and for your 3,000 gil reward.

